# NeuroSync frontend build-time configuration.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ and INLINES them into the
# built JavaScript bundle. Never put real secrets here - anything in this file
# becomes publicly visible to every visitor.
#
# VITE_API_URL - the base URL the browser uses for API calls.
#   * Leave UNSET when the SPA and API are served from the same origin behind a
#     reverse proxy that forwards "/api" to the backend (the recommended Docker
#     setup). The client then calls "/api" on its own origin, so no CORS is
#     involved.
#   * Set it to the API origin when the API is hosted separately, e.g.
#     https://api.example.com/api  (no trailing slash). The backend must then
#     list the frontend origin in CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_API_URL=
